⨯ keywords: `abstract` is a keyword and may not be used as an identifier
  @ test.idl:3:12

 2 │ const long SIZE = 10;
 3 │ const long abstract = SIZE + 5;      // 'any' is a keyword
   │            ˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆ this is an IDL keyword

